<title>USA: Freddie Mac sets $325 mln REMIC 1926.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets $325 mln REMIC 1926.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (FHLMC or Freddie Mac) said it issued $325 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC series 1926, underwritten by Bear Stearns Cos Inc, has a coupon of 7.5 percent and is backed by callable pass-through series C031, Freddie Mac said. The issue priced on December 18 and has a settlement date of January 30, FHLMC said.</p>
<p>Callable pass-through C031 is made up of $325 million of 30-year single-family fixed rate mortgages, the agency said.</p>
<p>((-- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
